WEBVTT

NOTE One Week (1920) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.990
Buster Keaton in "One Week"

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.250
Written and directed by
Buster Keaton and Eddie Cline

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.400
[music]

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:28.750
The wedding bells have such a
sweet sound but such a sour
echo.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.500
Handy Hank, the fellow
she turned down.

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.250
"Here's your house!"

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.000
"Breakfast is ready!"

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.000
"I'll be right down!"

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:20.500
"I've had a lovely afternoon on
your merry-go-round. It'll be
better when you put in your
hobby-horses."

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:53.750
And after the storm—

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:22.500
"Now look at the darned thing!"

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:27.250
"I guess it's not
used to the climate."

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:44.000
"You're on the wrong lot. Yours
is across the railroad track."

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:16.990
THE END
